[
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 1.0040000000000013,
    "end": 1.1039999999999992,
    "text": "OK."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 2.3530000000000015,
    "end": 6.554000000000002,
    "text": "There are numerous reasons. Everything."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 8.009999999999998,
    "end": 10.350999999999999,
    "text": "Pick something. Today's weather, sports."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 11.155000000000001,
    "end": 29.878999999999998,
    "text": "There are numerous reasons for weather, sports, and many other things. What am I supposed to say here? You're doing too well. So for these ones, it's just one line, one line. OK. Gotcha. But great. All right. You can move on to your next one. Walk towards the light."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 15.375,
    "end": 24.299999999999997,
    "text": "How do we screw it up? You're doing too well. So for these ones, it's just one one-on-one. Oh, okay. Yes, but..."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 31.503999999999998,
    "end": 32.005,
    "text": "What's it like?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 34.396,
    "end": 35.717,
    "text": "The pool is deep."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 36.367,
    "end": 37.408,
    "text": "Yeah, it's cold, too."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 39.059,
    "end": 40.58,
    "text": "The train accelerated."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 41.887,
    "end": 44.53,
    "text": "It was so fast, I couldn't even see what I was doing."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 45.583,
    "end": 46.663,
    "text": "The room is dim."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 48.17400000000001,
    "end": 55.843,
    "text": "But you can barely see a little bit in the corner over there. It's deep too."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 51.486000000000004,
    "end": 52.787000000000006,
    "text": "The water is freezing."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 57.83,
    "end": 59.751000000000005,
    "text": "The shoes are underneath the bed."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 60.649,
    "end": 62.391000000000005,
    "text": "Okay, not in the closet."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 64.386,
    "end": 74.279,
    "text": "The cat is hunting a mouse. The slender tree swayed gently in the breeze."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 75.105,
    "end": 76.226,
    "text": "I queue up every time I watch"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 78.665,
    "end": 81.168,
    "text": "The expansive field was perfect for a picnic."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 82.871,
    "end": 89.035,
    "text": "it. Well, as long as you're not playing softball."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 95.6,
    "end": 96.761,
    "text": "There are several options."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 97.508,
    "end": 99.17,
    "text": "How many options are there exactly?"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 100.143,
    "end": 101.064,
    "text": "The floor is slippery."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 101.752,
    "end": 110.28,
    "text": "I know, I fell already. Ah, but it's deep enough to snorkel in if you're careful."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 103.826,
    "end": 104.26599999999999,
    "text": "Oh, you're good."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 105.67599999999999,
    "end": 106.857,
    "text": "The water, it's shallow."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 111.80000000000001,
    "end": 112.84100000000001,
    "text": "We took a leisurely walk."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 113.523,
    "end": 115.225,
    "text": "Yes, we did. Keep up with me."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 116.38300000000001,
    "end": 117.16300000000001,
    "text": "The sun is bright."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 118.24700000000001,
    "end": 118.62799999999999,
    "text": "Duh."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 119.88499999999999,
    "end": 120.76599999999999,
    "text": "The kettle is boiling."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 121.47,
    "end": 123.05199999999999,
    "text": "Well, then pick it up and make some tea."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 124.168,
    "end": 125.40899999999999,
    "text": "Okay, he walked through the door."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 126.32300000000001,
    "end": 128.765,
    "text": "as opposed to literally walking through the door."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 129.611,
    "end": 130.632,
    "text": "The voice is resonant."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 132.008,
    "end": 133.829,
    "text": "It's got a rich, full timber."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 134.974,
    "end": 136.555,
    "text": "The children are playing in the park."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 137.252,
    "end": 139.034,
    "text": "Thank God they're not playing in the backyard."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2760",
    "start": 140.398,
    "end": 141.579,
    "text": "The day is bright and sunny."
  },
  {
    "speaker": "P2759",
    "start": 142.196,
    "end": 144,
    "text": "It's beautiful out today. Awesome."
  }
]